# Normalize line endings.
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout rewrites tracked files to CRLF, which makes
# `gofmt -l` flag every untouched Go file and — more to the point — would put
# CRLF into the Linux container image. Everything here is text that wants LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.db binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
